                      className="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base text-slate-200"
                    />
                    <p className="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">姣忕瓒婄晫妫€娴嬬殑棰戠巼</p>
